"text":"Above the roar of many waters—the mighty breakers of the sea—the LORD on high is majestic.","verse":4},{"matchingRule":"reviewed_exact_headword","phrase":"LORD","senseEvidence":{"basis":"reviewed_capitalized_divine_title","originalCitations":[],"ruleId":"Lord::LORD::reviewed_capitalized_divine_title","sourceHeadwordId":"Lord"},"text":"Your testimonies are fully confirmed; holiness adorns Your house, O LORD, for all the days to come.","verse":5}],"id":"Lord","label":"LORD","matchReviews":[{"ruleId":"Lord::LORD::reviewed_capitalized_divine_title","scope":"reviewed_capitalized_divine_title","senseReview":"Only literal uppercase LORD is admitted globally. Source Lord article explicitly covers God as Lord; lowercase human lord and sentence-title Lord are not inferred from this rule.","sourceHeadwordId":"Lord","term":"LORD"}],"matchingRule":"reviewed_exact_headword","matchingRules":["reviewed_exact_headword"],"sourceProvenanceId":"Lord","sourceTitle":"Lord"}],"format":"bsb-study-chapter-v2","notes":[{"chapterAssociationStatus":"canonical_reference","content":[{"c":["The Creator-King"],"sourceClass":"theme-title","t":"h"},{"c":["God created and established the world; the whole of creation is his handiwork (",{"href":"?bref=Gen.1.1-2.25","r":"Gen.1.1-2.25","rawR":"Gen.1.1-2.25","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Gen.1.1-2.25","value":"Gen.1.1-2.25"}],"t":"ref","v":"Gen 1–2"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Ps.24.1-2","r":"Ps.24.1-2","rawR":"Ps.24.1-2","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.24.1-2","value":"Ps.24.1-2"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ps 24:1-2"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Ps.95.4-5","r":"Ps.95.4-5","rawR":"Ps.95.4-5","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.95.4-5","value":"Ps.95.4-5"}],"t":"ref","v":"95:4-5"},"). He also rules over his creation, governing and caring for all that he has made (",{"href":"?bref=Ps.95.6-7","r":"Ps.95.6-7","rawR":"Ps.95.6-7","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.95.6-7","value":"Ps.95.6-7"}],"t":"ref","v":"95:6-7"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Ps.96.10","r":"Ps.96.10","rawR":"Ps.96.10","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.96.10","value":"Ps.96.10"}],"t":"ref","v":"96:10"},")."],"sourceClass":"theme-body-fl","t":"p"},{"c":["Several psalms celebrate the manifestation of God’s glory in creation (",{"href":"?bref=Ps.8.1-9","r":"Ps.8.1-9","rawR":"Ps.8.1-9","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.8.1-9","value":"Ps.8.1-9"}],"t":"ref","v":"Pss 8"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Ps.19.1-14","r":"Ps.19.1-14","rawR":"Ps.19.1-14","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.19.1-14","value":"Ps.19.1-14"}],"t":"ref","v":"19"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Ps.28.1-9","r":"Ps.28.1-9","rawR":"Ps.28.1-9","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.28.1-9","value":"Ps.28.1-9"}],"t":"ref","v":"28"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Ps.33.1-22","r":"Ps.33.1-22","rawR":"Ps.33.1-22","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.33.1-22","value":"Ps.33.1-22"}],"t":"ref","v":"33"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Ps.89.1-52","r":"Ps.89.1-52","rawR":"Ps.89.1-52","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.89.1-52","value":"Ps.89.1-52"}],"t":"ref","v":"89"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Ps.104.1-35","r":"Ps.104.1-35","rawR":"Ps.104.1-35","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.104.1-35","value":"Ps.104.1-35"}],"t":"ref","v":"and 104"},"). ",{"href":"?bref=Ps.8.1-9","r":"Ps.8.1-9","rawR":"Ps.8.1-9","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.8.1-9","value":"Ps.8.1-9"}],"t":"ref","v":"Psalm 8"}," centers on God’s endowing human beings with splendor and vesting them as his rulers in creation. ",{"href":"?bref=Ps.19.1-14","r":"Ps.19.1-14","rawR":"Ps.19.1-14","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.19.1-14","value":"Ps.19.1-14"}],"t":"ref","v":"Psalm 19"}," encourages reflection on creation in order to cultivate wisdom. ",{"href":"?bref=Ps.29.1-11","r":"Ps.29.1-11","rawR":"Ps.29.1-11","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.29.1-11","value":"Ps.29.1-11"}],"t":"ref","v":"Psalm 29"}," reveals God’s power in the world and the stability of his creation. ",{"href":"?bref=Ps.33.1-22","r":"Ps.33.1-22","rawR":"Ps.33.1-22","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.33.1-22","value":"Ps.33.1-22"}],"t":"ref","v":"Psalm 33"}," exalts God’s governance, order, and wisdom in creation and underscores the importance of fearing the Lord. In ",{"href":"?bref=Ps.89.1-52","r":"Ps.89.1-52","rawR":"Ps.89.1-52","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.89.1-52","value":"Ps.89.1-52"}],"t":"ref","v":"Psalm 89"},", God’s covenant with David is founded on God’s commitment to creation (",{"href":"?bref=Ps.89.9-18","r":"Ps.89.9-18","rawR":"Ps.89.9-18","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.89.9-18","value":"Ps.89.9-18"}],"t":"ref","v":"89:9-18"},")."],"sourceClass":"theme-body","t":"p"},{"c":[{"href":"?bref=Ps.93.1-100.5","r":"Ps.93.1-100.5","rawR":"Ps.93.1-100.5","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.93.1-100.5","value":"Ps.93.1-100.5"}],"t":"ref","v":"Psalms 93–100"}," reflect on God’s worldwide dominion. The earth belongs to him, and the Creator has demonstrated his power in history. ",{"href":"?bref=Ps.104.1-35","r":"Ps.104.1-35","rawR":"Ps.104.1-35","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.104.1-35","value":"Ps.104.1-35"}],"t":"ref","v":"Psalm 104"}," is a creation hymn that reworks the six days of creation into a marvelous lyric in praise of God’s wisdom."],"sourceClass":"theme-body","t":"p"},{"c":["Scripture calls upon all nations to acknowledge and praise God and to show their acceptance of his sovereign rule (see ",{"href":"?bref=Ps.9.11","r":"Ps.9.11","rawR":"Ps.9.11","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.9.11","value":"Ps.9.11"}],"t":"ref","v":"9:11"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Ps.47.1-2","r":"Ps.47.1-2","rawR":"Ps.47.1-2","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.47.1-2","value":"Ps.47.1-2"}],"t":"ref","v":"47:1-2"},", ",{"href":"?bref=Ps.47.7-9","r":"Ps.47.7-9","rawR":"Ps.47.7-9","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.47.7-9","value":"Ps.47.7-9"}],"t":"ref","v":"7-9"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Ps.66.8","r":"Ps.66.8","rawR":"Ps.66.8","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.66.8","value":"Ps.66.8"}],"t":"ref","v":"66:8"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Ps.117.1","r":"Ps.117.1","rawR":"Ps.117.1","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.117.1","value":"Ps.117.1"}],"t":"ref","v":"117:1"},")."],"sourceClass":"theme-body","t":"p"},{"c":["Passages for Further Study"],"sourceClass":"theme-refs-title","t":"h"},{"c":[{"href":"?bref=Gen.1.1-2.4","r":"Gen.1.1-2.4","rawR":"Gen.1.1-2.4","sourceRefs"